OL,3,GFEATURES CWhen did the Michael Peters
OL,4,CBBC logo officially launch?
OL,5,
OL,6,FARCHIVE: The TV Room
OL,7,
OL,8,FJust when did the version of the BBC's
OL,9,Fcorporate logo used in the late-80s and
OL,10,F90s get unveiled?
OL,11,
OL,12,FThe corporate logo appears in a festive
OL,13,Fpromo for BBC Records/Books/Videos,
OL,14,Ftransmitted on BBC Two on 29th November
OL,15,F1987.
OL,16,
OL,17,FIt also appears in an inset graphic in
OL,18,Fan edition of the Nine o'Clock News
OL,19,Ffrom 9th December 1987 (available on
OL,20,FYouTube).
OL,21,
OL,23,Uppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,135,120,200,120,0,100
PN,13402
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F134A1768692024
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}          G2/8
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CWhen did the Michael Peters
OL,4,CBBC logo officially launch?
OL,5,
OL,6,FWe understand the logo also appeared in
OL,7,Fthe 3rd December edition of the Nine
OL,8,Fo'Clock News.
OL,9,
OL,10,FThe new logo also featured in a See for
OL,11,FYourself supplement in the 2nd ` 8th
OL,12,FJanuary 1988 issue of the Radio Times.
OL,13,
OL,14,FThe introduction of this version of the
OL,15,Flogo was gradual.
OL,16,
OL,17,FIt was the latest evolution of the BBC
OL,18,Fboxes first seen in the late-50s.
OL,19,
OL,23,Uppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,135,120,200,120,0,100
PN,13403
SC,0003
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F134A1768692024
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}          G3/8
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CWhen did the Michael Peters
OL,4,CBBC logo officially launch?
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut from the mid-70s on, the corporate
OL,7,Flogo was used less and less on screen `
OL,8,Fit was notably withdrawn from the BBC
OL,9,FOne idents in 1974 and from generic
OL,10,Fnews bulletins in 1976.
OL,11,
OL,12,FAfter about 1982 it was rarely seen
OL,13,Fexcept in the copyright tag on end
OL,14,Fcredits.B
OL,15,
OL,16,FThe corporate logo, by stealth, came to
OL,17,Fbe seen purely as the logo of the
OL,18,Fcorporation itself ` not as part of the
OL,19,Fbranding for its services.
OL,20,
OL,23,Uppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,135,120,200,120,0,100
PN,13404
SC,0004
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F134A1768692024
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}          G4/8
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CWhen did the Michael Peters
OL,4,CBBC logo officially launch?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe decision to invest in a new logo in
OL,7,F1987 was an interesting one. It came at
OL,8,Fa time when the BBC was under fire and
OL,9,Fneeded to reassert itself and regain
OL,10,Fits confidence.B
OL,11,
OL,12,FWas it commissioned after Michael
OL,13,FCheckland took over as director-general
OL,14,Fin 1987? Or under his predecessor
OL,15,FAlastair Milne who was sacked in
OL,16,Fcontroversial circumstances?
OL,17,
OL,23,Uppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,135,120,200,120,0,100
PN,13405
SC,0005
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F134A1768692024
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}          G5/8
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CWhen did the Michael Peters
OL,4,CBBC logo officially launch?
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore intriguingly, was there always a
OL,7,Flong-term plan to use it on screen
OL,8,Fagain? Or was it initially just meant
OL,9,Fto represent the corporation itself?
OL,10,
OL,11,FAt this time it's worth noting it was
OL,12,Fnot uncommon for individual programmes
OL,13,Fto have their own headed notepaper with
OL,14,Fno corporate branding.
OL,15,
OL,16,FThe first meaningful on-screen use came
OL,17,Fwith the introduction of the BBC Sport
OL,18,Fanimation at the time of the Seoul
OL,19,FOlympics.
OL,20,
OL,23,Uppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,135,120,200,120,0,100
PN,13406
SC,0006
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F134A1768692024
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}          G6/8
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CWhen did the Michael Peters
OL,4,CBBC logo officially launch?
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome regional news programmes also
OL,7,Fstarted to use the new logo.
OL,8,
OL,9,FBut there was clearly no rush to push
OL,10,Fthe logo onto screens.
OL,11,
OL,12,FThe new look Nine o'Clock News launched
OL,13,Fa few weeks after the Olympics ` with
OL,14,Fbold graphics from Lambie-Nairn ` had
OL,15,Fno sign of it but it would have been
OL,16,Feasy enough to add it on.
OL,17,
OL,23,Uppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,135,120,200,120,0,100
PN,13407
SC,0007
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F134A1768692024
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}          G7/8
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CWhen did the Michael Peters
OL,4,CBBC logo officially launch?
OL,5,
OL,6,FBBC Breakfast News launched with a
OL,7,Fgraphic forming the letters BBC with no
OL,8,Frelation whatsoever to the corporate
OL,9,Flogo.B
OL,10,
OL,11,FIt took until 1993 for the BBC News to
OL,12,Fbe rebranded and consistently use the
OL,13,Fcorporate logo though it started
OL,14,Fcreeping in about two years before.
OL,15,
OL,16,FCopyright tags started using it as
OL,17,Fstandard on 1st January 1990.
OL,18,
OL,23,Uppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,135,120,200,120,0,100
PN,13408
SC,0008
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F134A1768692024
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}          G8/8
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CWhen did the Michael Peters
OL,4,CBBC logo officially launch?
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnd presentation, of course, started
OL,7,Fusing the corporate logo with the
OL,8,FFebruary 1991 rebrand.
OL,9,
OL,10,FSo was there always a long-term plan to
OL,11,Fuse the logo prominently? Or did it
OL,12,Fhappen by stealth as branding became
OL,13,Fmore important with the start of
OL,14,Fmultichannel TV?
OL,15,
OL,16,FIt would be interesting to know.
OL,17,
OL,23,Uppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
